{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00031",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 5.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Good morning, you know, doctor. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.72,
      "end_seconds": 8.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.32,
      "end_seconds": 17.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Hmm, it's puffiness around the eyes in the morning. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.86,
      "end_seconds": 21.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.5,
      "end_seconds": 33.24,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "For six months, I'd say. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.9,
      "end_seconds": 50.09,
      "duration_seconds": 16.19,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.72,
      "end_seconds": 52.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.07,
      "end_seconds": 56.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Have you had any nausea, breathlessness or blood in the urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.28,
      "end_seconds": 62.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "No nausea, breathlessness or blood in the urine, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.95,
      "end_seconds": 65.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.26,
      "end_seconds": 68.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No, um, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.75,
      "end_seconds": 74.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Alright, what about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.77,
      "end_seconds": 80.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "My mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.3,
      "end_seconds": 84.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.43,
      "end_seconds": 100.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "I mean, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.74,
      "end_seconds": 101.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.6,
      "end_seconds": 105.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.3,
      "end_seconds": 112.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.79,
      "end_seconds": 116.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.97,
      "end_seconds": 121.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.62,
      "end_seconds": 127.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "I've, I've had diabetes, yes. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.37,
      "end_seconds": 132.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.13,
      "end_seconds": 137.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.86,
      "end_seconds": 138.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.57,
      "end_seconds": 156.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.73,
      "end_seconds": 158.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.0,
      "end_seconds": 163.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.56,
      "end_seconds": 166.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.01,
      "end_seconds": 170.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.55,
      "end_seconds": 173.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Aspirin. I come out in... well, wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.28,
      "end_seconds": 177.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.85,
      "end_seconds": 178.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.96,
      "end_seconds": 191.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.02,
      "end_seconds": 195.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.48,
      "end_seconds": 198.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.18,
      "end_seconds": 199.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.59,
      "end_seconds": 231.44,
      "duration_seconds": 21.85,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: It fits best with progression of the kidney problem. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had puffiness around the eyes in the morning for six months, and no breathlessness or nausea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.42,
      "end_seconds": 235.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Um, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.38,
      "end_seconds": 250.6,
      "duration_seconds": 14.22,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.9,
      "end_seconds": 253.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Hmm, okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.37,
      "end_seconds": 281.45,
      "duration_seconds": 27.08,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a urine protein test for chronic kidney disease. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Keep an eye on salt and protein portions, a dietitian can help with the specifics. Stay off anti-inflammatory painkillers like diclofenac or ibuprofen, they're hard on the kidneys. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.36,
      "end_seconds": 297.43,
      "duration_seconds": 15.07,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back in four weeks. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.86,
      "end_seconds": 302.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.66,
      "end_seconds": 308.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.38,
      "end_seconds": 312.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.59,
      "end_seconds": 314.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}